# Part 1: Find Eigenfunctions and Eigenenergies

## Activity 1
For this activity, use the finite difference approximation for the Hamiltonian:
```math
\frac{d^2}{dx^2}\phi(x) \approx \frac{-\hbar^2}{2m\delta x^2}\phi_{i-1} + \frac{2\hbar^2}{2m\delta x^2}\phi_i-\frac{-\hbar^2}{2m\delta x^2}\phi_{i+1}
```
